DESCRIPTION:INDIVIDUAL PLAYER DEVELOPMENT IN AGE GROUP SETTING<br><br>Impro
 ve your touch\, creativity\, and technique! ‬  Tech Training is individual
 -based player development training in an age-group setting.  Mayrin Soto\,
   Specialty Training Operations Managers leads the program.<br><br>- A tec
 hnical training program for all SLSG Players.<br>- Sign-up is by individua
 l player\; it is not a team event.<br>- U6 to U14 age groups<br>- Boys and
  Girls<br>- Missouri and Illinois and The Woods (St. Charles)<br>- 6 sessi
 ons on Saturday mornings<br>- The times vary by facility (double check the
  schedule on link below) <br>- Weather-related cancellations will be poste
 d on Twitter (X) - @SLSGfacilities<br>- There is no cost for SLSG players\
 , but all players need please to RSVP.<br>- There are off weeks in the mid
 dle of the program due to SLSG Tournaments\, double check schedule.<br><br
 >TECH TRAINING LOCATIONS:<br>Missouri - WWT Soccer Park - Field 6<br>Illin
 ois - SLSG Collinsville - Turf <br>St. Charles - SLSG The Woods - Main Fie
 ld<br><br>MISSOURI* AGE GROUPS:<br>9:00am - 10:15am (U9\, U10\, U11\, U12\
 , U13\, U14 - boys and girls)<br>10:15am - 11:30am (U6\, U7\, U8 - boys an
 d girls)<br><br>*Illinois and The Woods are:<br>9:00am - 10:15am (U6-U14 -
  Boys and Girls)<br><br>SCHEDULE:<br>https://www.slsgsoccer.com/tech-train
 ing<br><br>ITEMS TO NOTE:<br>In order to staff the session correctly\, we
 ask all players to RSVP on Playmetrics.<br>The Woods only have 3 dates.  M
 issouri and Illinois have 6 per season. <br>The Woods and Illinois only ha
 ve one session with all of the age groups.  Missouri has 2 sessions.  <br>
 The cost is included in club dues. There are no make ups due to facility p
 lans.<br>Weather related cancellations will be posted on twitter - @SLSGfa
 cilities and if we we are able\, emailed through the sign-up list (we are
 sometimes in the field and can not).<br><br>RSVP on your Playmetrics Calen
 dar
